          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Moses oneno ni lwak wigi oteŋ woko, (pien Aron aye omiyo wigi oteŋ, kun oweko lewic omakogi i kin lukworgi), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ci Moses ocuŋ i doggaŋ me gony, owaco ni, “Aŋa ma tye tuŋ bot Rwot? Obin bota.” Ci awobe pa Levi ducu gucokke kacel bote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci owaco botgi ni, “Rwot Lubaŋa pa jo Icrael owaco kuman ni ‘Dano acel acel oket pala lucwanne i lakŋete, wek ocit kwede i dye gony kun wirre kwede dok i doggaŋ tuŋ cel ki tuŋ cel, orum iye, kun ŋat man neko ominne, ŋat man neko latugi, ki ŋat man neko lawote.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:27"
          },
          "items": [
